# The MSI is built on a GitHub windows runner, which checks the tree out with
# Git for Windows. Left to autocrlf, every script here would arrive with CRLF
# line endings and fail as `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory` —
# a failure that names the wrong thing and wastes an afternoon.
*.sh text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.sed text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf

# Binary assets, so git never tries to translate them.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.msi binary
*.exe binary
